## Model Performance

The confusion matrix below shows the performance of the final Logistic Regression model on the test dataset.

- True Negatives (4165): Non-racist/non-sexist tweets correctly classified.
- True Positives (263): Racist/sexist tweets correctly detected.
- False Positives (293): Safe tweets incorrectly flagged as harmful.
- False Negatives (74): Harmful tweets missed by the model.

The model achieved:
- Accuracy: 92.35%
- Precision (Racism/Sexism): 47%
- Recall (Racism/Sexism): 78%
- F1-Score (Racism/Sexism): 59%

The results indicate that the model prioritizes identifying harmful content, achieving high recall while accepting a moderate number of false positives.
